<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19431" root="سر" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَّآءُ</span></b>  <i>Ampleness,</i> or <i>freedom from straitness, of
the means,</i> or <i>circumstances, of life;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَخَآءٌ</span>;
[or <i>a happy state</i> or <i>condition;</i>] <i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرَّآءُ</span>;
(S;) <i>i. q.</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَرَّةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَارُورَآءُ</span></b>  [<i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَرَّةٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَارُورَآءُ</span>]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُرُورٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِرٌّ</span>,
near the end of the paragraph. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  Also <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطْحَآءُ</span>
[q. v.]. (TA.)

